#. Tag: title
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Opis"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:123
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kmymoney; is the Personal Finance Manager for the &kde; environment. It "
"provides the functions required to balance your checkbooks, manage your "
"personal loans and categories your incomes and expenses using a checkbook "
"style graphical user interface."
msgstr ""
"&kmymoney; je upravitelj ličnih finansija za &kde; okruženje. Omogućava "
"korištenje funkcija neophodnih za balansiranje vaše čekovne knjižice, za "
"upravljanje pozajmicama i kategorijama prihoda i rashoda korištenjem "
"čekovnog stila grafičkog korisničkog sučelja."

#. Tag: title
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid "Options"
msgstr "Opcije"

#. Tag: replaceable
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid "File"
msgstr "Datoteka"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid "file to open"
msgstr "datoteka koju treba otvoriti"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:145
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>-n</option>"
msgstr "<option>-n</option>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:147
#, no-c-format
msgid "Start without opening a file"
msgstr "Započnite bez otvaranja datoteke"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:154
#, no-c-format
msgid "--timers"
msgstr "--timers"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable performance timers"
msgstr "Omogućiti korištenje tajmera performansi"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid "--nocatch"
msgstr "--nocatch"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:165
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do not globally catch uncaught exceptions"
msgstr "Nemojte hvatati globalno neuhvaćene izuzetke"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid "--trace"
msgstr "--trace"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turn on program traces. This option is only available when &kmymoney; is "
"compiled in debug mode."
msgstr ""
"Uključite tragove programa. Ova opcija je dostupna samo je kada &kmymoney; "
"kompajliran u debug modu."

#. Tag: option
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid "--dump-actions"
msgstr "--dump-actions"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:183
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Dump the names of all defined KAction objects to stdout and quit. This "
"option is only available when &kmymoney; is compiled in debug mode."
msgstr ""
"Promijenite imena svih definisanih KAction objekata u stdout i quit. Ova "
"opcija je dostupna samo kada je &kmymoney; kompajliran u debug modu."

#. Tag: option
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:190
#, no-c-format
msgid "--help"
msgstr "--help"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:192
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show help about options"
msgstr "Prikaži pomoć za opcije"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:199
#, no-c-format
msgid "--help-qt"
msgstr "--help-qt"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show Qt specific options"
msgstr "Prikaži Qt specifične opcije"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:208
#, no-c-format
msgid "--help-kde"
msgstr "--help-kde"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:210
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show KDE specific options"
msgstr "Prikaži KDE specifične opcije"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:217
#, no-c-format
msgid "--help-all"
msgstr "--help-all"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:219
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show all options"
msgstr "Prikaži sve opcije"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:226
#, no-c-format
msgid "--author"
msgstr "--author"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:228
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show author information"
msgstr "Prikaži podatke o autorima"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:235
#, no-c-format
msgid "-v, --version"
msgstr "-v, --version"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:237
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show version information"
msgstr "Prikaži podatke o verziji"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:244
#, no-c-format
msgid "--license"
msgstr "--license"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:246
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show license information"
msgstr "Prikaži podatke o licenci"

#. Tag: title
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:257
#, no-c-format
msgid "Environment"
msgstr "Okruženje"

#. Tag: term
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:261
#, no-c-format
msgid "$<envar>KDE_LANG</envar>"
msgstr "$<envar>KDE_LANG</envar>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:263
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Language locale setting to use. This option makes it possible to set another "
"language environment for a program than what is the default. The correct "
"language pack for this language has to be installed for this option to work. "
"The default language when there is none set is en_US. When deciding upon a "
"language, the following resources are looked up, in order: <envar>KDE_LANG</"
"envar>, configuration file, <envar>LC_CTYPE</envar>, <envar>LC_MESSAGES</"
"envar>, <envar>LC_ALL</envar>, <envar>LANG</envar>."
msgstr ""
"Postavka upotrebe lokalnog jezika. Ova opcija je dostupna samo kada je za "
"neki program postavljen neki drugi jezik u odnosu na onaj koji je unaprijed "
"određen za upotrebu. Odgovarajući jezički paket mora biti instaliran da bi "
"ova opcija radila. Ako ova opcija nije korištena unaprijed određeni jezik za "
"upotrebu je en_US. Prilikom donošenja odluke o tome koji će se jezik "
"koristiti, trebaju se pogledati sljedeći resursi, u ovom redoslijedu: "
"<envar>KDE_LANG</envar>, konfiguracijska datoteka, <envar>LC_CTYPE</envar>, "
"<envar>LC_MESSAGES</envar>, <envar>LC_ALL</envar>, <envar>LANG</envar>."

#. Tag: term
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:274
#, no-c-format
msgid "$<envar>KDE_UTF8_FILENAMES</envar>"
msgstr "$<envar>KDE_UTF8_FILENAMES</envar>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:276
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Assume that all filenames are in UTF-8 format regardless of the current "
"language setting. Otherwise the filename format is defined by the language."
msgstr ""
"Pretpostavi da su sva imena datoteka u UTF-8 formatu neovisno od trenutne "
"postavke jezika. U suprotnom, format naziva datoteke je definisan jezikom "
"koji se koristi."

#. Tag: term
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:283
#, no-c-format
msgid "$<envar>KDE_MULTIHEAD</envar>"
msgstr "$<envar>KDE_MULTIHEAD</envar>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:285
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this variable has the value true multihead multiple display mode is "
"enabled. The KDE display will be shared over more than one screen."
msgstr ""
"Ako ova varijabla ima vrijednost tačno, uključen je višeglavni višestruki "
"prikaz. Prikaz KDE-a će biti podijeljen na više od jednog ekrana."

#. Tag: term
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:291
#, no-c-format
msgid "$<envar>DISPLAY</envar>"
msgstr "$<envar>DISPLAY</envar>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:293
#, no-c-format
msgid "Specifies the X display to run KDE on."
msgstr "Specificira X ekran na kojem će KDE biti pokrenut."

#. Tag: term
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:298
#, no-c-format
msgid "$<envar>SESSION_MANAGER</envar>"
msgstr "$<envar>SESSION_MANAGER</envar>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:300
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The session manager to use. This option is set automatically by KDE and is a "
"network path to the session manager socket."
msgstr ""
"Upravitelj sesija koji će se koristiti. Ova opcija je automatski postavljena "
"od strane KDE-a, a to je mrežni put do utora za upravitelj sesija."

#. Tag: term
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:306
#, no-c-format
msgid "$<envar>HOME</envar>"
msgstr "$<envar>HOME</envar>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:308
#, no-c-format
msgid "Path to the home directory for the current user."
msgstr "Putanja do korijenskog direktorija za trenutnog korisnika."

#. Tag: term
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:313
#, no-c-format
msgid "$<envar>KDEHOME</envar>"
msgstr "$<envar>KDEHOME</envar>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:315
#, no-c-format
msgid "The KDE per-user setting directory."
msgstr "Direktorij za svakog KDE korisnika pojedinačno."

#. Tag: title
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:323
#, no-c-format
msgid "See Also"
msgstr "Također pogledajte"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kmymoney.1.docbook:325
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The full documentation for &kmymoney; is maintained as a docbook manual. If "
"the &khelpcenter; program is properly installed at your site, the command "
"<userinput><command>khelpcenter</command> <parameter>help:/kmymoney</"
"parameter></userinput> should give you access to the complete manual. "
"Alternatively the manual can be browsed in &konqueror; giving it the "
"<acronym>URL</acronym> <ulink url=\"help:/kmymoney\">help:/kmymoney</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"Potpuna dokumentacija za &kmymoney; je sadržana u obliku docbook priručnika. "
"Ako je &khelpcenter; program ispravno instaliran na vašoj stranici, komanda "
"<userinput><command>khelpcenter</command> <parameter>help:/kmymoney</"
"parameter></userinput> bi vam trebala omogućiti pristup kompletnom "
"priručniku. Alternativno, priručnik se može pregledati u &konqueror;-u tako "
"se u njega ukuca <acronym>URL</acronym> <ulink url=\"help:/kmymoney\">help:/"
"kmymoney</ulink>."
